   $q$What does Ms. Oyelaran's warning that "something else waits another year" add to the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It reveals that she is angry with Dae-jung for ignoring her list.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It shows that choosing which voices to preserve has real costs, which makes the decision more serious.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that she does not believe the ledger is worth reading.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It suggests that the historical society is about to close for good.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows that choosing which voices to preserve has real costs, which makes the decision more serious.$q$, $q$With limited funding, adding the ledger delays other records, so remembering one voice means postponing another. She reads "for a long time" and then reorders the list, so she clearly values the ledger.$q$, 'draft', 'd3f6bc26-2ac5-5558-9e14-0c71661a3691')
