   $q$How does Mrs. Kowalczyk's question develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Her polite question reveals that the app does not fit how residents already sign up for rides.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that she did not understand any part of the presentation.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It proves that the residents were rude and uninterested in Marisol's work.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It suggests that she wants Marisol to add a signature feature to the app.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Her polite question reveals that the app does not fit how residents already sign up for rides.$q$, $q$Asking "Where do I write my name?" after the full demonstration shows the residents still think in terms of the clipboard. The residents watched "politely," so calling them rude misreads the scene.$q$, 'draft', 'f762e003-ca09-57c3-a8a2-d833a7afaabe')
