   $q$What is the author's main purpose in writing this sign?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To explain why dead trees are left standing and to persuade visitors to value them","is_correct":true},{"text":"To ask visitors to report any dead trees they see so that staff can remove them","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-viewpoint"},{"text":"To warn visitors that dead trees along the trail are likely to fall without notice","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"To teach visitors how to tell the difference between oaks and other forest trees","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To explain why dead trees are left standing and to persuade visitors to value them$q$, $q$The sign answers the question of why snags remain ("We leave them standing on purpose") and invites visitors to appreciate them. It says the snags near the trail have been checked, so it is not warning that they will fall.$q$, 'draft', 'cc97a657-c4a9-53ca-be12-656d8a1b34e2')
