   $q$Which event do both texts describe?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A mill reopening and dyeing the river new colors.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Fish returning to a river after a mill dam is removed.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Volunteers building a new dam to control spring floods.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"A student failing to finish a community service project.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Fish returning to a river after a mill dam is removed.$q$, $q$Yusuf counts herring the year after "the old mill dam came down," and the river in the poem says "they took down the wall across my throat" before fish swim in. Neither text describes a new dam.$q$, 'draft', 'f3773370-9e38-55ca-b9b8-ff228a411527')
