   $q$According to the passage, what happens to a result set with a tailwind above the fixed limit?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It still counts for placing in the meet but cannot become an official record.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It is removed from the meet, and the athlete must jump again in calmer air.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It is entered as a record only if a second gauge confirms the wind reading.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It is reduced by a set distance before the final placings are announced.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It still counts for placing in the meet but cannot become an official record.$q$, $q$The first paragraph states that such a result "still counts for placing in that meet, but it cannot be entered as an official record." Nothing in the passage says results are reduced or that jumps are repeated.$q$, 'draft', 'd041ab23-cde4-562a-ab06-5030fa931ce9')
